  "notes": "1470 Owens Street -- a UCSF parking structure serving multiple UCSF Mission Bay life-science buildings and the adjacent Kaiser Permanente Mission Bay Medical Offices (1600 Owens St), designed by WRNS Studio; garage entrance on Nelson Rising Lane off Owens St. Features a green-wall security screen and 25 EV charging spaces (per the structural engineer's own project page and ParkChirp's facility listing). Owner-identified while reviewing the numbered real-gap-fragment map for this session's positioning check. DataSF Assessor confirms blklot 8709019 at 1470 Owens St; this record uses the real Assessor parcel boundary (the DataSF Building Footprints layer has no captured footprint at all for this parcel, likely a parking-structure gap in that dataset).",
